    <bpmn:process id="W_W3289" name="W3289. Ending Stock &amp; Weeks-of-Supply (WOS) Target Planning by Category" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Seasonal/annual plan (W3281/W3282)
Frequency: Seasonal
Volume: ~40 categories
Owner: Merchandise Planner
Participants: Merchandise Planner, Category Managers, Supply Planning (links to VS-02.1), Allocation (links to VS-55)
Source: workflow W3289 — Ending Stock &amp; Weeks-of-Supply (WOS) Target Planning by Category</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3289_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3289_Lane1" name="Merchandise Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3289_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3289_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3289_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3289_Lane2" name="Category Managers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3289_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3289_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3289_Start4" name="Seasonal/annual plan (W3281/W3282)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3289_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3289_Task5" name="Merchandise Planner set EOM stock targets and weeks-of-supply (WOS) by category…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner set EOM stock targets and weeks-of-supply (WOS) by category using forward demand (links to VS-02.1), lead time (domestic 7–21d / import 45–90d per VS-02.2), safety-stock policy (A/B/C per profile §6.6), and seasonality
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Seasonal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3289_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3289_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3289_Task6" name="Category Managers confirm category WOS supports service-level targets and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Category Managers confirm category WOS supports service-level targets and key-item availability; reconcile to receipt plan (W3284) and store-cluster needs (W3302)
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Seasonal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3289_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3289_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3289_Task7" name="Merchandise Planner publish WOS/EOM targets to supply planning and allocation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandise Planner publish WOS/EOM targets to supply planning and allocation; monitor actual WOS weekly (W3288) and flag over/under-stock
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Seasonal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3289_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3289_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3289_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3289_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-533 (ensure controlled execution — Inventory Investment, Turn &amp; Productivity Planning (PA-101.2).) | - operational: OTB discipline (W3283); operational: safety-stock policy and reforecast (W3288)
Owner: Merchandise Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3289_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3289_Annotation9" targetRef="W3289_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
