    <bpmn:process id="W_W3290" name="W3290. Inventory Turn &amp; GMROI Target Setting &amp; Performance Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual plan; monthly performance review
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~40 categories
Owner: Merchandise Planner
Participants: Merchandise Planner, Category Managers, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Finance (links to VS-17.1)
Source: workflow W3290 — Inventory Turn &amp; GMROI Target Setting &amp; Performance Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3290_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3290_Lane1" name="Merchandise Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3290_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3290_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3290_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3290_Lane2" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3290_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3290_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3290_Start4" name="Annual plan; monthly performance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3290_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3290_Task5" name="Merchandise Planner set inventory-turn targets (corporate 6–8x per profile…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner set inventory-turn targets (corporate 6–8x per profile §12.3) and GMROI (gross-margin return on inventory investment) targets by category, benchmarking to category role (destination vs routine vs seasonal)
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3290_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3290_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3290_Task6" name="Merchandise Planner/Finance track actual turn and GMROI monthly by category…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Merchandise Planner/Finance track actual turn and GMROI monthly by category, isolate drivers (sales velocity, stock level, margin), and flag underperformers for action (markdown W3285, cancel W3284, transfer links to VS-05.2)
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3290_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3290_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3290_Task7" name="VP Merchandising review category turn/GMROI with Category Managers quarterly…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Merchandising review category turn/GMROI with Category Managers quarterly; reallocate OTB and space (links to VS-55.3) toward higher-productivity categories and exit chronic underperformers (W3293)
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3290_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3290_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3290_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3290_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-533 (ensure controlled execution — Inventory Investment, Turn &amp; Productivity Planning (PA-101.2).) | - operational: GMROI discipline and space reallocation; operational: maintained-margin modeling (W3286)
Owner: Merchandise Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3290_Assoc10" sourceRef="W3290_Annotation9" targetRef="W3290_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
