    <bpmn:process id="W_W3291" name="W3291. Stock-to-Sales Ratio &amp; Flow Planning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Seasonal plan; flow/receipt scheduling
Frequency: Seasonal
Volume: ~40 categories × 12 months
Owner: Merchandise Planner
Participants: Merchandise Planner, Supply Planning (links to VS-02.1), DC ops (links to VS-04), Buyers (links to VS-03)
Source: workflow W3291 — Stock-to-Sales Ratio &amp; Flow Planning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3291_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3291_Lane1" name="Merchandise Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3291_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3291_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3291_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3291_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3291_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3291_Start3" name="Seasonal plan; flow/receipt scheduling">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3291_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3291_Task4" name="Merchandise Planner set monthly stock-to-sales ratio targets by category…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner set monthly stock-to-sales ratio targets by category (beginning stock as a multiple of the month&#x27;s planned sales) to ensure flow supports demand without overstock
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Seasonal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3291_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3291_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3291_Task5" name="Merchandise Planner/Supply Planning convert stock-to-sales targets into a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Merchandise Planner/Supply Planning convert stock-to-sales targets into a receipt flow plan timed to lead times (domestic/import) and DC capacity (links to VS-04.3); smooth receipts to avoid inbound peaks
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Seasonal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3291_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3291_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3291_Task6" name="Merchandise Planner monitor actual stock-to-sales weekly (W3288) and adjust…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandise Planner monitor actual stock-to-sales weekly (W3288) and adjust flow (chase/cancel/transfer) to maintain target
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3291_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3291_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3291_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
