    <bpmn:process id="W_W3292" name="W3292. New-Store Inventory Investment Planning &amp; Pre-Open Stock Build" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New-store project (links to VS-37)
Frequency: ~10–15 new stores/year (per profile §3.1)
Volume: Per new store (~35,000 SKU initial stock)
Owner: Merchandise Planner
Participants: Merchandise Planner, Allocation (links to VS-55), New-Store team (links to VS-37), Buyers (links to VS-03), Finance (links to VS-40)
Source: workflow W3292 — New-Store Inventory Investment Planning &amp; Pre-Open Stock Build</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3292_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3292_Lane1" name="Merchandise Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3292_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3292_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3292_Lane2" name="Buyers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3292_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3292_Lane3" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3292_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3292_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3292_Start5" name="New-store project (links to VS-37)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3292_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3292_Task6" name="Merchandise Planner/Allocation develop the new-store initial stock (HOT /…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner/Allocation develop the new-store initial stock (HOT / hand-over stock) plan by department/category based on store format (8,000–15,000 sqm), cluster, and localization (links to VS-55.3 W2186); size the inventory investment and OTB impact
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / Allocation
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3292_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3292_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3292_Task7" name="Buyers/Supply Planning procure initial stock to land pre-opening per the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Buyers/Supply Planning procure initial stock to land pre-opening per the store-opening plan (links to VS-37.1/VS-37.2); coordinate DC staging (links to VS-04) and phased fill to avoid single-day inbound overload
Responsible (R): Buyers / Supply Planning
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3292_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3292_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
