      <bpmn:userTask id="W3292_Task8" name="Finance/Merchandise Planner capitalize and track the new-store inventory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Merchandise Planner capitalize and track the new-store inventory investment (links to VS-40 capex), confirm OTB absorption, and reconcile post-opening to plan (links to VS-37.3 stabilization)
Responsible (R): Finance / Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3292_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
