Volume: ~40% import / ~60% domestic split (per profile §6.5)
Owner: Merchandise Planner
Participants: Merchandise Planner, Import/Buyers (links to VS-02.2/VS-03), Customs (links to VS-87), Treasury (links to VS-18.3), Finance (links to VS-17.1)
Source: workflow W3295 — Import vs Domestic Inventory Investment &amp; Landed-Cost Margin Planning</bpmn:documentation>
