      <bpmn:userTask id="W3295_Task6" name="Merchandise Planner/Import model landed cost for import SKUs (product cost +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner/Import model landed cost for import SKUs (product cost + freight + duty/tariff per VS-87 + brokerage + insurance per VS-02.2 W191) vs domestic cost; compute margin under each sourcing option and FX scenario (links to VS-18.3)
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / Import
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3295_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3295_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3295_Task7" name="Category Managers decide import-vs-domestic mix per SKU/category considering…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Category Managers decide import-vs-domestic mix per SKU/category considering landed-cost margin, lead time (45–90d import), quality (links to VS-31), MOQ, and duty-deferral/bonded options (links to VS-87.2/VS-02.2 W284); commit OTB accordingly (W3284)
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Buyers
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3295_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3295_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3295_Task8" name="Finance/Merchandise Planner track actual landed-cost margin vs plan, isolate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Merchandise Planner track actual landed-cost margin vs plan, isolate duty/FX/freight variance, and feed to margin plan (W3286) and close (links to VS-17.1)
Responsible (R): Finance / Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3295_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
