    <bpmn:process id="W_W3296" name="W3296. Inventory Investment Scenario Modeling &amp; Working-Capital Constraint" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual plan; strategic review; cash/working-capital constraint (links to VS-18.1)
Frequency: Quarterly + on demand
Volume: Group-level scenarios
Owner: Merchandise Planner
Participants: Merchandise Planner, FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Treasury (links to VS-18.1), VP Merchandising, CFO
Source: workflow W3296 — Inventory Investment Scenario Modeling &amp; Working-Capital Constraint</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3296_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3296_Lane1" name="Merchandise Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3296_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3296_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3296_Lane2" name="Treasury">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3296_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3296_Lane3" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3296_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3296_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3296_Start5" name="Annual plan; strategic review; cash/working-capital constraint (links to VS-18.1)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3296_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3296_Task6" name="Merchandise Planner/FP&amp;A model inventory-investment scenarios (growth vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner/FP&amp;A model inventory-investment scenarios (growth vs conservative vs working-capital-constrained) across the plan: project EOM inventory $, OTB, cash tied up, turn, and margin under each
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3296_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3296_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3296_Task7" name="Treasury/CFO set the working-capital/cash constraint (links to VS-18.1 cash…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury/CFO set the working-capital/cash constraint (links to VS-18.1 cash forecast); Merchandise Planner right-size OTB and receipt flow (W3284) to fit the cash envelope without breaching service-level targets
Responsible (R): Treasury / Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3296_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3296_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3296_Task8" name="VP Merchandising/CFO select the plan scenario, communicate OTB and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Merchandising/CFO select the plan scenario, communicate OTB and inventory-investment limits to Buyers/Planners, and monitor adherence via weekly P&amp;A (W3288) and monthly cash review (links to VS-18.1)
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising / CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3296_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3296_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3296_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
