        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-533 (ensure controlled execution — Inventory Investment, Turn &amp; Productivity Planning (PA-101.2).) | - operational: working-capital-constrained scenario; operational: scenario trade-off analysis
Owner: Merchandise Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
